   "text": "· five tabs: Overview (the whole build at a glance, what is new at this level first), Skills, Tree, Inventory, About;",
   "originalText": "· five tabs: Overview (the whole build at a glance, what is new at this level first), Skills, Tree, Inventory, About;",
